<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-02T18:37:28.964Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 18:37:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to carry out attacks across northern Nigeria, killing civilians and security forces in Plateau, Zamfara and Kaduna, while bandits ambushed a police convoy in Zamfara and abducted six mourners transporting a corpse on the Benue highway. Troops rescued five victims of a Plateau village attack and arrested two herders searching for stolen weapons, but a mining pit collapse in Plateau killed one person. A building collapse in Nigeria has been reported to have caused losses of ₦4.6 trillion over four years and 321 deaths in ten years. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQdGoxa3dHNW5ZcWtwRjNzRXk2bF82NDRlckoxY0lkamRyYW0zZkg2VHZOUHlYT1VjWHhELVUtczJRYzdsMThhbURoWHpEX0FNb25pZmdFYlRoNXQ0VjlHNDB3dGd3NHVaTUVaM2tfZ2FoSWU3X3pqQnNVZU85RjQ1YklBdkNndm5PYWFyOXJ1eUhSY0dKYnRaT0NUUWNnZkdY?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQb3NXc2JGUU5BeERBUGw4a2ZqUzA2ZlAwWDJ6SEVGR2ZVaVl3eVJPSE5aUFliTGhta3QyT1I1WldzRnhsajlfQnIwMVdRaGxKb3NsMlF3T2hEOVdOTGdaWkdoUkFUaVVRVmF5RjBhcm41NFFWLW56MEtwYWhNRFBTZ1RKRWQ0bHRSR1I2Z1hMUE9GdkVkUEQxcDU1djBhTTRy?oc=5&quot;&gt;OsunDefender&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNRXJfSVNBNU1JVUhyVmsxeTdBdkFET0kzRFpndWIwLUZwalNMYVRGYVduVFNFWG1MLWlLT1N5WS02eHN3ZVdJcU9zSnV6RW8zdkRzOTJkNlN0YVRBdUx6SXlsUkV2Q29fcWhyWUNwWElCdXdRVmk2dDNJMlBTMk10RUp4OVpaQTNOQUdYM1dOQ0poLXJ0bmF6dU9UVnVRckFpMS1GR04zWkEyalVMUkpFS2oyQmNidnhGN2p0Y1cyX0Y?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tribune Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTFBtOVpUQWdIU3dVc3E4UGMwNHJNa3o4QTZlSWpGc0lwUlFhbF9BSDEyN0dXUWt0OXpNMkl6UH